Let me check the _selectJurors function more carefully, specifically the selection algorithm:

```solidity
for (uint i = 0; i < JURY_SIZE; i++) {
    uint256 idx = (_seed + i * 31) % poolSize;
    while (used[idx]) {
        idx = (idx + 1) % poolSize;
