When the message has `\n` in it (as a literal string), the `f" {message}"` embeds it directly. 

The problem is that the post message format in Feishu expects actual newline characters within the text field, not escaped `\n` sequences. The f-string interpolation is just passing through the escape sequences as-is instead of interpreting them, so I need to either process the message with something like `textwrap.dedent` and `textwrap.fill`, or use a different approach to handle the actual line breaks before they get embedded in the JSON structure.

